<title>USA: First Savings Bancorp net rises.</title>
<headline>First Savings Bancorp net rises.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTHERN PINES, N.C. 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q1 ended</p>
<p>September 30, 1996.     1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary	     $ 0.26		    $0.24</p>
<p> Net			  1,051			947</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	 3,974		    3,984</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The above excludes a one-time SAIF charge of approximately $1.2 million. Net income for the quarter including the nonrecurring charge to earnings was $301,000.</p>
